4. **Step 4 - Already Processed** (Code) — combines the duplicate-check-and-passthrough into a single node (`if (total > 0) return [];`), unlike upstream agents which use a separate IF-node-plus-dedicated-Set-node pattern. **Note: unlike ALA/EIP/ESS/HSI, this path does not log a `skip_reason` field when dropping a duplicate — it's a silent drop with no recorded reason.** Otherwise rebuilds the full 28-field record.
